---
/* Homepage hero: registration chip, headline, CTAs, and the proof strip. */
---

<header class="wrap hero-visual-shell">
  <div class="reg-chip">NDPC REGISTERED · NDPC/DCP/13596</div>
  <h1>We build the <em>African datasets</em> your models are missing — to your specification.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    BSG DataWorks collects, annotates, and licenses human-sourced speech, image, video, and
    language data across Nigeria and West Africa. Tell us what your model needs; we recruit
    the speakers, run the collection, and deliver rights-cleared, consent-documented data
    your legal team can sign off on.
  </p>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">Commission a dataset</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#samples">Hear a sample first</a>
  </div>

  <div
    class="hero-mobile-art"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Illustration representing African AI training data across speech, image, video, and language"
  ></div>

  <div class="hero-proof-grid" aria-label="BSG DataWorks dataset evidence">
    <div class="proof-card proof-ready">
      <span class="proof-kicker">Ready to evaluate</span>
      <strong>Nigerian English and Yorùbá speech</strong>
      <p>Representative samples and time-aligned transcripts available for technical review.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-card proof-qa">
      <span class="proof-kicker">Native-speaker QA</span>
      <strong>Human review at every delivery stage</strong>
      <p>Transcriptions, annotations, and metadata checked against agreed quality criteria.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="proof-card proof-rights">
      <span class="proof-kicker">Rights-ready</span>
      <strong>Consent-documented commercial data</strong>
      <p>Built with contributor records and a clear audit trail for AI training use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero-visual-shell { padding: 70px 0 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate }

  .reg-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: .78rem;
    color: var(--green-deep);
    background: var(--mist);
    border: 1px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .reg-chip::before { content: ""; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green) }

  .hero-sub { max-width: 680px; margin: 22px 0 32px; font-size: 1.12rem; color: #3C4A42 }

  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 54px }

  /* Brand illustration: desktop background wash, separate mobile panel. */
  .hero-visual-shell::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -70px -80px -40px -80px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg,
        rgba(248, 247, 242, .985) 0%,
        rgba(248, 247, 242, .94) 42%,
        rgba(248, 247, 242, .30) 72%,
        rgba(248, 247, 242, .02) 100%),
      url("/assets/images/bsg-home-hero-illustration.png") center right/cover no-repeat;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-mobile-art { display: none }

  /* Proof strip: visual evidence without changing the SEO hierarchy. */
  .hero-proof-grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 42px;
  }
  .proof-card {
    min-height: 138px;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(20, 35, 28, .10);
  }
  .proof-card .proof-kicker {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: .10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: .9;
  }
  .proof-card strong { display: block; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.16 }
  .proof-card p { margin-top: 10px; font-size: .86rem; line-height: 1.45; opacity: .92 }

  .proof-ready { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A4A2C, #0E6B3F) }
  .proof-qa { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #155C79, #2C7FA3) }
  .proof-rights { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #A66313, #C98A1B) }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero-visual-shell::before { display: none }
    .hero-visual-shell { padding-bottom: 0 }
    .hero-mobile-art {
      display: block;
      margin: 2px -24px 28px;
      height: 330px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #031321 url("/assets/images/bsg-home-hero-mobile.png") center 64%/cover no-repeat;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(9, 43, 76, .16);
    }
    .hero-proof-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-bottom: 36px }
  }
</style>
